        "created_at": "2014-08-21T14:17:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't want crossover to Spirit Island, there's no need for heroes in that game. &nbsp;I would be okay with a subtle connection through art in the card game or even a mini-expansion environment that was set on the island.</p><p>I doubt they would do it, since they don't want to blend games like that, to the point of making Tactics stand alone from the card game with a lack of cross promotion.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:47:48.997Z",
