        "created_at": "2014-08-22T12:14:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm also on the side of \"No crossover, please\". The game has the potential to be genuinely fun by its own. As I see it, it is simply another story to be told to us by the GTG crew.</p>",
